    finalColor *= exp(-r*1.5); // Fade out

    fragColor = vec4(finalColor, 1.0);
}

This may produce some effects, but possibly not cohesive. Maybe the pattern should be multiplied with the color.

Alternatively, use:

vec3 finalColor = color1 * pattern;

